sequenceDiagram
  actor C as Customer
  participant S as Supervisor
  participant G as ToolGateway
  participant P as Payment gateway
  participant O as OCS
  C->>S: Recharge 10 dollars
  S->>G: payment.initiate (RECHARGE, pm_ok)
  G->>G: validate, policy, confirmation required
  G-->>C: Confirm: pay 10.00 with method ending 0512?
  C->>S: YES
  S->>G: confirm(action_id)
  G->>P: charge (idempotency key)
  alt provider returns SUCCESS
    P-->>G: SUCCESS + reference
    G->>O: recharge.apply (only after verified SUCCESS)
    O-->>G: new balance
    G-->>C: Recharge applied, reference PAY-...
  else DECLINED
    P-->>G: FAILED
    G-->>C: Declined. Nothing applied.
  else PENDING or timeout
    P-->>G: PENDING or no answer
    G->>G: status OUTCOME_UNKNOWN, no retry
    G-->>C: Not confirmed yet. Will not be reported as paid until reconciled.
    G->>P: reconcile (authoritative status)
  else OCS fails after payment SUCCESS
    G-->>C: Payment taken, top-up not applied. Specialist notified. You will not be charged again.
  end
